# 11. Complexity

Let `L` = length of the word/prefix.

| Operation  | Time   |
| ---------- | ------ |
| Insert     | `O(L)` |
| Search     | `O(L)` |
| StartsWith | `O(L)` |

### Space

For `N` words with maximum length `L`:

```text
Worst Case → O(N × L)
```

But common prefixes are shared, so practical space can be less.

